00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:24.464
YOU LOSE YOUR FREEDOM.

00:08:24.465 --> 00:08:26.833
I THINK DURING THAT PERIOD, IT

00:08:26.834 --> 00:08:29.569
DOES NOT MAKE SENSE TO HAVE AN

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:31.004
