00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:48.288
MEANS THEY NEED THE RIGHT TO

00:08:48.289 --> 00:08:52.425
VOTE TO BE REINSTATED.

00:08:52.426 --> 00:08:54.060
&gt;&gt; Dana: ELIZABETH WARREN, SHE

00:08:54.061 --> 00:08:55.562
IS TRYING TO SOLVE A DIFFERENT

00:08:55.563 --> 00:08:56.763
PROBLEM AND THAT'S THAT AFTER

00:08:56.764 --> 00:08:57.464
YOU'VE SERVED YOUR DEBT TO

00:08:57.465 --> 00:08:58.865
