00:09:13.281 --> 00:09:13.914
SEXUAL ASSAULT BUT THAT'S

00:09:13.915 --> 00:09:15.282
TOTALLY DIFFERENT FROM PEOPLE

00:09:15.283 --> 00:09:16.683
BEING ABLE TO VOTE IN PRISON.

00:09:16.684 --> 00:09:18.685
I THINK MAYOR PETE HAD A MUCH

00:09:18.686 --> 00:09:19.819
