00:09:19.820 --> 00:09:20.120
NIGHT.

00:09:20.121 --> 00:09:22.889
&gt;&gt; Greg: I THINK THAT WIFE

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:28.929
MAYOR PETE IS RISING, BUT

00:09:28.930 --> 00:09:29.996
BECAUSE HE'S NOT CRAZY.

00:09:29.997 --> 00:09:32.465
&gt;&gt; Emily: IS IT A PRIVILEGE OR

00:09:32.466 --> 00:09:33.833
AS A RIGHT?

00:09:33.834 --> 00:09:34.467
