I DO FEEL LIKE A LOT OF THEM

00:10:13.908 --> 00:10:16.943
BASED ON THEIR EXPERIENCE ARE

00:10:16.944 --> 00:10:19.813
WHOLEHEARTEDLY FOR LIMITED

00:10:19.814 --> 00:10:20.380
